# SM8250 (Snapdragon 865) — Retroid Pocket 5 / Flip2 / Mini / Mini V2, AYN Thor Lite,
# MANGMI Pocket Max. Unlike SM8550/SM8650, almost the whole SM8250 firmware set is OPEN:
# even adsp/cdsp ship in linux-firmware under qcom/sm8250/, so they are rows HERE rather
# than per-board republished blobs in qcom-firmwares. See QCOM_FW.pin for the two that are
# genuinely missing (slpi, and the Thor Lite's amp calibration).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Adreno 650 GPU microcode + zap shader (open).
